        {
          "content": "<p>秘鲁的金矿区有无数探矿坑，雨后积水，空中看下去矿脉闪闪发光，就像一条条“金河”。虽然很漂亮，但这是砍伐森林而形成的，造成了巨大的环境破坏。（<a href=\"https://petapixel.com/2021/02/12/photo-from-space-reveals-gold-rivers-slicing-through-the-amazon/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">via</a>）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "via",
              "url": "https://petapixel.com/2021/02/12/photo-from-space-reveals-gold-rivers-slicing-through-the-amazon/"
            }
